*> PLB-C040 odo-object-too-small: the DEPENDING ON object cannot hold
*> the table's largest count.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ODOSIZE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  SMALL-COUNT         PIC 99 VALUE 0.
01  BIG-COUNT           PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01  EXACT-COUNT         PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01  ORDERS.
    05  ORDER-LINE      PIC X(20) OCCURS 1 TO 500 DEPENDING ON SMALL-COUNT.
01  ITEMS.
    05  ITEM-LINE       PIC X(20) OCCURS 1 TO 500 DEPENDING ON BIG-COUNT.
01  NOTES.
    05  NOTE-LINE       PIC X(20) OCCURS 0 TO 999 DEPENDING ON EXACT-COUNT.
01  FLAGS.
    05  FILLER          PIC X OCCURS 0 TO 10 DEPENDING ON SMALL-COUNT.
01  TINY-COUNT          PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01  MARKS.
    05  FILLER          PIC X OCCURS 0 TO 10 DEPENDING ON TINY-COUNT.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 5 TO SMALL-COUNT BIG-COUNT EXACT-COUNT TINY-COUNT
    DISPLAY ORDERS ITEMS NOTES FLAGS MARKS
    STOP RUN.
